SUMMARY:Juneteenth World Cup Watch Party : USA  vs Australia
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nCome join us in celebrating Juneteen
 th and the World Cup by watching the USMNT face off against Australia. In 
 the first group stage matches the USA dominated Paraguay and Australia han
 dled Turkey\, so this match may decided the winner of Group D.\n\nBeer stu
 dy is another great place to watch footie in the Triangle. They have a wid
 e selection craft drinks and also have some tasty food & cocktails next do
 or at their restaurant The Boot Room.\n\nWe'll be there about an hour befo
 rehand to allow folks to chat and get settled before things kickoff at 3pm
  EST.\n\n\\*While this location does have a large parking lot\, it can fil
 l up quickly for big matches like this. Make sure to look for spots behind
  the building or check for street parking across from the plaza.
