SUMMARY:Rhianna Skate Night @ Wheels
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nOh ***yeah***\, you read that correc
 tly! Rihanna Skate Night. What better way to celebrate the holiday weekend
  than like THIS.\n\nIt's not free\, you need to buy a ticket and sign a wa
 iver. There is price to skates as well if you don't already own some. This
  is so much fun! I went with 0 training and had a blast. Please feel free 
 to join regardless of skill level.\n\nSee ya there
