SUMMARY:Romance Book Club: Book Lovers
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nY’all know I love me an Emily Henr
 y book and I think this is probably my favorite one.\n\nCome join us at Na
 mu for a fun chat about “Book Lovers” with some cool people!\n\nI’ll
  arrive ahead of time and will post in the chat where we’ll be located.
