SUMMARY:🎵 Music Bingo Monday @ Gizmo Brew Works 🍻
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nThink you know your music? Prove it.
 \n\nJoin us Monday night at Gizmo Brew Works - Durham Taproom for Music Bi
 ngo — where your useless knowledge of 90s one-hit wonders\, guilty pleas
 ure pop songs\, classic rock anthems\, and random songs buried deep in you
 r Spotify playlists might finally pay off.\n\nNo singing required. No triv
 ia team needed. Just grab a drink\, listen for the songs\, mark your card\
 , and see if your questionable music taste can carry you to victory.\n\nWh
 ether you grew up burning CDs\, downloading songs from LimeWire\, curating
  the perfect iPod playlist\, or pretending you discovered bands before the
 y were cool\, there’s a good chance you’ll recognize more songs than y
 ou think. Winners take home prizes and bragging rights.\n\nWe’ll grab a 
 table around 6:30 PM and play a few rounds together. (Rescheduling to late
 r in June)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31508
 0947/
